### Send backyard shade Up (close). Requires SHADE_ENABLED=true.
### Empty 202 acknowledges transmitter process completion, not physical movement.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shades/backyard/up
Accept: application/json

###

### Send backyard shade Down (open). Requires SHADE_ENABLED=true.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shades/backyard/down
Accept: application/json

###

### Send backyard shade My (stop). Requires SHADE_ENABLED=true.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shades/backyard/my
Accept: application/json

###

### 409 means a send is active or cleanup is uncertain; 500 may follow RF emission.
### Do not automatically retry failed shade commands.
